Hi,

be sure to specify factors in the newdata data.frame using the same order for the levels as you have in the original data set. This can cause issues with predictions. In your example, you seem to be using a different order for the levels of WetlandType - compare str(AmtiAbundUmfY1) and str(newData).

Best,

Marc

